  "content": "<h1>已封存</h1><p>Cobblepedia 將不會再有任何重大更新。</p><p>我中止了這個專案，以專注於開發 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-knowlogy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Cobblemon Knowlogy 模組</strong></a>，這是一個較新的模組，同樣會將維基資訊以書本形式加入遊戲中，並且會定期更新以跟上 Cobblemon 的版本。</p><h1>Cobblepedia</h1><p>一個基於 <a href=\"https://github.com/VazkiiMods/Patchouli/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a> 的遊戲內寶可夢圖鑑書本物品，適用於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitlab.com%252fcable-mc%252fcobblemon%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a>，顯示來自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.cobblemon.com%252findex.php%252fMain_Page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon 官方維基</a> 的資訊，並追蹤 Cobblemon 新增的進度。</p><h2>特色：</h2><ul>\n<li>符合 Cobblemon 美學的自訂 UI 紋理（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcobblepedia%252fgallery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看圖庫</a>）</li>\n<li>進度</li>\n<li>合成配方</li>\n<li>基礎教學</li>\n</ul><h2>如何取得寶可夢圖鑑：</h2><ul>\n<li>完成「選擇入門寶可夢」進度後獲得；</li>\n<li>使用一本書與任意樹果合成；</li>\n<li>在創造模式中（可在「工具與 utilities」創造模式標籤頁中找到）；</li>\n<li>或使用指令：在 Minecraft 1.20.1 版中使用 <code>/give @s patchouli:guide_book{\"patchouli:book\": \"cobblepedia:cobblepedia\"}</code>，或在 1.21.1 版中使用 <code>/give @p patchouli:guide_book[patchouli:book=\"cobblepedia:cobblepedia\"]</code>（需要啟用作弊 / 管理員權限）。</li>\n</ul><h2>模組需求</h2><h3><em>Patchouli</em></h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpatchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p><p>此模組提供將寶可夢圖鑑加入遊戲的功能。</p><h3><em>Cobblemon</em></h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p><p>此模組新增書本中所說明的內容。</p><h2>推薦</h2><h3><em>Cobblemon Interface</em> 資源包</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcobblemon-interface\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cobblemon-interface\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p><p>更改 Minecraft 介面，使其與 Cobblemon 的 UI 更為協調。</p><h3><em>PatchouliButton</em> 模組</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpatchoulibutton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchoulibutton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p><p>在背包中新增一個列出寶可夢圖鑑的按鈕。您可以更改其設定，直接導向 Cobblemon 書本（對模組包製作者很有用）。</p><h2>在地化</h2><p>此模組包含以下語言的翻譯檔案：</p><ul>\n<li><strong>巴西葡萄牙語</strong> (pt_br)，由本人翻譯；</li>\n<li><strong>中文</strong> (zh_cn)，由 Gitlab 上的 <code>@x1759603258</code> 翻譯；</li>\n<li><strong>義大利語</strong> (it_it)，由 Discord 上的 <code>@mik_profilo_di</code> 翻譯；</li>\n<li><strong>西班牙語</strong> (es_es)，由 Discord 上的 <code>@lavinytuttini</code> 翻譯；</li>\n</ul><p><em>備註：部分翻譯已過時或不完整。</em></p><h2>其他：</h2><p>紋理基於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/torrezx-improved-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Torrezx-Improved Library</a> 資源包的書本，靈感來自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fSbIA8FKhwl0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">《寶可夢傳說 阿爾宙斯》預告片</a> 中的開場書本。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f934267676354834442%252f1091579923396820992\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.1.0/assets/compact/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> 位於 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon 官方 Discord 伺服器</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcobblepedia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fM4M5K4BDR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>",
